  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fairy Zi Wei identifies the red-light fighter harassing Nu Er Bao Xiong as senior Zhu Que Er, saying she cultivates fire path and transformation path and that her battle style counters him. Narration places her among Gu Immortals waking from the immortal graveyard.",
      "chapters": [
        1718
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_zi_wei",
        "char_nu_er_bao_xiong",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She uses a killer move that splits into eight red lights shooting at Nu Er Bao Xiong from different directions. Seven slam his lightning web shield; the remaining red light is her main body. When lightning spears from his beard rain toward her, she shouts, turns back into her body, and raises rainbow light as the surrounding air’s temperature rises.",
      "chapters": [
        1719
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fight-with-nu-er-bao-xiong",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She squeals and uses a movement killer move, drawing a bright red trail through the air and circling behind Calamity Luck Altar. Dong Fang Yu steps from the phantom River of Time to block her, and they fight a fierce battle.",
      "chapters": [
        1927
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "calamity-luck-altar-assault",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_calamity_luck_altar",
        "loc_river_of_time"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She joins Ye Qiao Zi attacking Wu Yong, then enters Zhou Xiong Xin’s rumor cage battlefield with Zhang Fei Xiong. Narration states she and Zhang Fei Xiong have transformation path attainment and turn into information path immemorial desolate beasts to help the fight.",
      "chapters": [
        1932
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rumor-cage-battlefield",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ye_qiao_zi",
        "char_wu_yong",
        "char_zhou_xiong_xin",
        "char_zhang_fei_xiong"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With Bai Cang Shui, Zhao Shan He, and others of Heavenly Court’s main force she steps forward under attack. She and Prince Feng Xian combine skills; flames form a new defensive line that blocks several rank seven Immortal Gu Houses. A sword light then pierces the battlefield, and she falls like a sparrow whose wings were cut, her body slashed into two halves.",
      "chapters": [
        1951
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death-in-heavenly-court",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_bai_cang_shui",
        "char_zhao_shan_he",
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "char_prince_feng_xian",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house"
      ]
    }
